# Only VITE_* variables are readable from the browser bundle — never put
# secrets or credentials here (see CLAUDE.md: "Nada de secretos en el front").

# Base URL for the API. Must be relative ("/api/v1") or on the SAME SITE as the web app:
# the session lives in a SameSite=Strict HttpOnly cookie that browsers don't send cross-site.
# In dev, Vite proxies /api to the API (vite.config.ts); in Docker, nginx does (docker/nginx.conf).
# Optional — falls back to "/api/v1" if unset.
VITE_API_URL=/api/v1
